 | 3D+ | Flattened to 2D |
 
 Only InCore-type functions (InCore, AIC, AIV) are processed. Orchestration and Opaque functions are returned unchanged.
+
+
+### Padded multi-ND Mat source windows
+
+On a backend with `SupportsMultiNdMatLoad`, a non-packed rank-3 ND GM view
+keeps its original source window and element strides; only its destination
+Tile becomes 2D. A `[P,32,128]` view with strides `[page_bytes,128,1] loaded
+as `[2,32,128]` therefore retains the page gap while producing `[64,128]`
+Mat storage. Packed sources keep the previous 2D collapse. Unsupported backends
+reject this path instead of silently treating the source as dense.
